package com.example.billing;

import org.springframework.boot.SpringApplication;
import org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.SpringBootApplication;

@SpringBootApplication
public class BillingApplication {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SpringApplication.run(BillingApplication.class, args);
    }
}
```

A component in `com.example.billing.web` is below this package and is found by the default scan. A component in `com.example.shared` is outside it; move the component under the application root, import its configuration, or configure a deliberate scan boundary.

